{"id":70331,"date":"2025-08-29T08:24:37","date_gmt":"2025-08-29T07:24:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=70331"},"modified":"2026-10-20T22:46:53","modified_gmt":"2026-10-20T21:46:53","slug":"maratona-de-bruges-2026","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-bruges-2026\/","title":{"rendered":"Maratona de Bruges 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Maratona de Bruges 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Maratona de Bruges 2026<\/strong> (oficialmente <strong>Athora Bruges Marathon<\/strong>, 9\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>11 de outubro de 2026<\/strong>, na hist\u00f3rica cidade de <strong>Bruges<\/strong>, na regi\u00e3o da Flandres, <strong>B\u00e9lgica<\/strong>. Com partida na ampla pra\u00e7a <strong>\u2019t Zand<\/strong> e chegada monumental na emblem\u00e1tica <strong>Grote Markt<\/strong> \u2014 em pleno centro hist\u00f3rico medieval classificado como Patrim\u00f3nio Mundial da UNESCO \u2014, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o re\u00fane cerca de 13.000 participantes de dezenas de nacionalidades num dos eventos de estrada mais r\u00e1pidos e pitorescos do outono europeu.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com percursos oficialmente medidos e homologados pela <strong>World Athletics<\/strong> na <strong>Maratona (42,195 km)<\/strong> e na <strong>Meia Maratona (21,097 km)<\/strong>, al\u00e9m da <strong>Family Walk de 10 km<\/strong> com passagem gastron\u00f3mica pela <em>Spermalie Hotel School<\/em>, o tra\u00e7ado destaca-se pelo perfil totalmente plano e r\u00e1pido, ideal para atacar recordes pessoais. Os atletas percorrem as ruas medievais e canais seculares de <strong>Bruges<\/strong> e seguem pelos p\u00f3lderes verdejantes da Flandres at\u00e9 \u00e0 encantadora vila hist\u00f3rica de <strong>Damme<\/strong>, contando com uma equipa completa de pacers e at\u00e9 oito postos de abastecimento.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Sob a dire\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica da <strong>Golazo Sports NV<\/strong>, a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o assegura secretariado, balne\u00e1rios e dep\u00f3sito gratuito de sacos no <strong>Sint-Lodewijkscollege<\/strong>, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica com acompanhamento em tempo real (Live Tracking), seguro desportivo, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial inclu\u00edda na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o da maratona, medalha exclusiva de finalista e anima\u00e7\u00e3o gastron\u00f3mica no <strong>Food Market<\/strong> instalado na pra\u00e7a \u2019t Zand. Consulta tamb\u00e9m o guia completo das principais <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/maratona\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Maratonas em Portugal<\/a> e planeia o teu ritmo na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">11 de Outubro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">\u2019t Zand (Partida) \/ Grote Markt (Meta), Bruges, B\u00e9lgica<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">42,195 km, 21,097 km, 10 km (Caminhada)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Golazo Sports NV<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">6h00 (Maratona) \/ 8 min\/km (Meia Maratona)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/athorabrugesmarathon.com\/en\/practical-info\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><br \/>\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Consultar Regulamento Oficial &rarr;<br \/>\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Athora Bruges Marathon (42,195 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 11 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Lote 1 (< 1.000 inscritos):<\/strong> 90.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Inclui T-shirt Oficial)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Lote 2 (1.001 a 3.000 inscritos):<\/strong> 95.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Inclui T-shirt Oficial)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Lote 3 (3.001 a 6.000 inscritos):<\/strong> 105.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Inclui T-shirt Oficial)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Lote 4 (> 6.000 inscritos):<\/strong> 110.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (At\u00e9 10\/10)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Meia Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Athora Bruges Half Marathon (21,097 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 11 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Lote 1 (< 1.000 inscritos):<\/strong> 45.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Inicial)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Lote 2 (1.001 a 3.000 inscritos):<\/strong> 50.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (2\u00ba Escal\u00e3o)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Lote 3 (3.001 a 6.000 inscritos):<\/strong> 55.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (3\u00ba Escal\u00e3o)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Lote 4 (> 6.000 inscritos):<\/strong> 60.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (At\u00e9 10\/10)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Athora Bruges Family Walk (10 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 11 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:45<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Lote 1 (< 1.000 inscritos):<\/strong> 27.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Inicial)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Lote 2 (1.001 a 3.000 inscritos):<\/strong> 29.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (2\u00ba Escal\u00e3o)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Lote 3 (> 3.000 inscritos):<\/strong> 31.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (At\u00e9 10\/10)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a Maratona de Bruges 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 9\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da Athora Bruges Marathon realiza-se no domingo, 11 de outubro de 2026, em Bruges, na B\u00e9lgica. A partida da Maratona (42,195 km) e da Meia Maratona (21,097 km) acontece em simult\u00e2neo \u00e0s 10:00 na pra\u00e7a \u2019t Zand, seguida da Family Walk (10 km) \u00e0s 10:45, com meta instalada na hist\u00f3rica Grote Markt.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e em que hor\u00e1rios posso levantar o dorsal e o kit de participante?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O levantamento do dorsal e kit decorre exclusivamente no Sint-Lodewijkscollege (Magdalenastraat 30, 8200 Brugge), a cerca de 1 km da linha de partida, no s\u00e1bado, 10 de outubro de 2026, entre as 11:00 e as 17:00, e no domingo, 11 de outubro, das 08:00 \u00e0s 10:45.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo em cada prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os pre\u00e7os variam por lotes de inscritos (incluindo 0,50 \u20ac de taxa municipal): a Maratona custa entre 90,00 \u20ac e 110,00 \u20ac (com t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial inclu\u00edda gratuitamente), a Meia Maratona varia entre 45,00 \u20ac e 60,00 \u20ac (t-shirt opcional por 29,95 \u20ac) e a Family Walk de 10 km situa-se entre 27,00 \u20ac e 31,00 \u20ac. Todas incluem dorsal personalizado (para inscri\u00e7\u00f5es at\u00e9 21 de setembro), cronometragem\/app live, seguro Sportinez, guarda-roupa gratuito, abastecimentos e medalha.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite oficial (cut-off) e que pacers est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tempo limite oficial da Maratona \u00e9 de 6 horas (encerramento da meta na Grote Markt \u00e0s 16:45), enquanto a Meia Maratona segue uma cad\u00eancia limite de 8 minutos por quil\u00f3metro. A prova disp\u00f5e de pacers oficiais para 2h59, 3h15, 3h30, 3h45, 3h59, 4h15, 4h30, 4h45 e 5h00 na Maratona, e de 1h30 a 2h30 (a cada 10 minutos) na Meia Maratona.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funcionam os abastecimentos, balne\u00e1rios e dep\u00f3sito de sacos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A Maratona conta com 8 postos de abastecimento (aos 3,8 km, 9,9 km, 16,2 km, 20,3 km, 25,3 km, 30,5 km, 35,5 km e 40,5 km) e a Meia Maratona com 4 postos. Os balne\u00e1rios, duches e a entrega de sacos de desporto (das 08:00 \u00e0s 10:00) funcionam no Sint-Lodewijkscollege, sendo a recolha do saco efetuada ap\u00f3s a meta na zona de \u2019t Zand at\u00e9 \u00e0s 17:30.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Maratona de Bruges 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-11\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"\u2019t Zand (Partida) \/ Grote Markt (Meta), Bruges\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Bruges\", \"addressRegion\": \"B\u00e9lgica\", \"addressCountry\": \"BE\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Golazo Sports NV\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza a Maratona de Bruges 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 9\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da Athora Bruges Marathon realiza-se no domingo, 11 de outubro de 2026, em Bruges, na B\u00e9lgica. A partida da Maratona (42,195 km) e da Meia Maratona (21,097 km) acontece em simult\u00e2neo \u00e0s 10:00 na pra\u00e7a \u2019t Zand, seguida da Family Walk (10 km) \u00e0s 10:45, com meta instalada na hist\u00f3rica Grote Markt.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e em que hor\u00e1rios posso levantar o dorsal e o kit de participante?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O levantamento do dorsal e kit decorre exclusivamente no Sint-Lodewijkscollege (Magdalenastraat 30, 8200 Brugge), a cerca de 1 km da linha de partida, no s\u00e1bado, 10 de outubro de 2026, entre as 11:00 e as 17:00, e no domingo, 11 de outubro, das 08:00 \u00e0s 10:45.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo em cada prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Os pre\u00e7os variam por lotes de inscritos (incluindo 0,50 \u20ac de taxa municipal): a Maratona custa entre 90,00 \u20ac e 110,00 \u20ac (com t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial inclu\u00edda gratuitamente), a Meia Maratona varia entre 45,00 \u20ac e 60,00 \u20ac (t-shirt opcional por 29,95 \u20ac) e a Family Walk de 10 km situa-se entre 27,00 \u20ac e 31,00 \u20ac. Todas incluem dorsal personalizado (para inscri\u00e7\u00f5es at\u00e9 21 de setembro), cronometragem\/app live, seguro Sportinez, guarda-roupa gratuito, abastecimentos e medalha.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite oficial (cut-off) e que pacers est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O tempo limite oficial da Maratona \u00e9 de 6 horas (encerramento da meta na Grote Markt \u00e0s 16:45), enquanto a Meia Maratona segue uma cad\u00eancia limite de 8 minutos por quil\u00f3metro. A prova disp\u00f5e de pacers oficiais para 2h59, 3h15, 3h30, 3h45, 3h59, 4h15, 4h30, 4h45 e 5h00 na Maratona, e de 1h30 a 2h30 (a cada 10 minutos) na Meia Maratona.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funcionam os abastecimentos, balne\u00e1rios e dep\u00f3sito de sacos?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A Maratona conta com 8 postos de abastecimento (aos 3,8 km, 9,9 km, 16,2 km, 20,3 km, 25,3 km, 30,5 km, 35,5 km e 40,5 km) e a Meia Maratona com 4 postos. Os balne\u00e1rios, duches e a entrega de sacos de desporto (das 08:00 \u00e0s 10:00) funcionam no Sint-Lodewijkscollege, sendo a recolha do saco efetuada ap\u00f3s a meta na zona de \u2019t Zand at\u00e9 \u00e0s 17:30.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":70335,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,31,41],"event_type_2":[1534,627],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-70331","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-bruges-belgica","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida","event_type-maratona","event_type-meiamaratona","event_type_2-belgica","event_type_2-europa"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-maratona-de-bruges.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/70331","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about"